One member of these lists has made some good points to me.. 

At this point I wish to apologise for my already admitted emotional
outburst. 

This emotional response came after 2 weeks of trying to nail down a
problem which initially got some response. HOwever (coincidentally) did
not receive any further response after I responded to further
information that was requested of me. . 

I understand that all people here have a huge workload that is voluntary
and I do respect that. I myself have poured much time into helping
develop my local music scene on a voluntary basis while also spending
time trying to configure and build my system into something useable for
music production that I can disseminate in the so-called underground
music community.I have sacrificed the release of at least 2 albums
spending time on these issues. 

 For those who can appreciate time-differences and I'm sure you can.. 
It is after 2am my local time and I am spending this time most nights
trying to resolve issues with this system and am usually non-demanding. 

All issues aside.. I'm sorry for this reaction.. I wish the best for all
working on linux audio projects 


Allan Klinbail 



